==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|impressionnisme}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{label|en|arts}} a [[movement]] in [[art]] characterized by [[visible]] [[brush]] [[stroke]]s, [[ordinary]] [[subject]] [[matter]]s, and an [[emphasis]] on [[light]] and its changing [[qualities]]
# {{label|en|music genre}} a [[style]] that avoided [[traditional]] [[harmony]], and sought to invoke the [[impression]]s of the [[composer]]
# {{label|en|poetry}} a style that used [[imagery]] and [[symbolism]] to portray the [[poet]]'s impressions

